{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf31 <strong>OrePlant: A Magical Fantasy World Awaits!</strong> \u2728</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Curious <strong>Finn\u00a0</strong>and <strong>Maru</strong> are drawn into a magical fantasy world by a mysterious force! \ud83c\udf00 There, the legendary <strong>World Tree</strong> stands tall, and your touch will gradually bring this mystical land back to life. \ud83c\udf33 With the help of your adorable companion, <strong>Aria</strong>, explore and nurture this enchanting world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/\uc778\ud2b8\ub85c_\ub9cc\ud654_EN_01_800px.png?t=1744936810\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/\uc778\ud2b8\ub85c_\ub9cc\ud654_EN_02_800px.png?t=1744936810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/line_800px.png?t=1744936810\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\ud83d\udc8e <strong>The Charm of Idle Gameplay</strong></u><br><br>A <strong>&quot;salary thief&quot; game</strong> where characters do all the work for you! \ud83d\udcb8<br>Enjoy the game even while working with <strong>Picture-in-Picture (PIP) mode</strong>! \ud83d\udda5\ufe0f\ud83d\udccb<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/_gif__pip_800px-min.gif?t=1744936810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fishing Content with the Adorable 'Dambi'</strong></u><br><br>You're not fishing alone! The cute weasel <strong>\u2018Dambi\u2019</strong> is here to help. \ud83e\udda6\ud83d\udc96<br>Relax by the water and enjoy a peaceful fishing experience with Dambi.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/_gif__fishing_800px-min.gif?t=1744936810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Automated Robots to Assist You</strong></u><br><br>Adorable <strong>automation robots</strong> will help cultivate minerals! \u26cf\ufe0f\ud83c\udf3f<br>Increase work efficiency and manage your farm more effectively.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/_gif__auto_800px-min.gif?t=1744936810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Diverse Cooking System</strong></u><br><br>Use harvested minerals, crops, and fish to create a variety of <strong>delicious dishes</strong>!<br>Cooked meals provide <strong>useful buffs</strong> to your characters. \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\u2728<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/gifcooking_800px-min-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1744936810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Exciting Story and Cinematic Presentation</strong></u><br><br>A <strong>heartwarming and immersive story</strong> awaits!<br>Join adorable and charming characters on an <strong>engaging adventure</strong> with captivating visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/_gif__story_01_800px-min.gif?t=1744936810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Customize Your Own Farm</strong></u><br><br>Create a <strong>cozy and unique</strong> space in your own style! \ud83c\udf33\u2728<br>Decorate with various items and turn your farm into a <strong>stunning background</strong>! \ud83c\udf04<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/_gif__building_800px-min.gif?t=1744936810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/line_800px.png?t=1744936810\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Recommended For</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players who love relaxing and healing games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fans of adorable graphics and creative customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Those who enjoy diverse gameplay styles like farming, fishing, and cooking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fans of games like Stardew Valley or Rusty Retirement will absolutely love it!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/line_800px.png?t=1744936810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><br><strong>OrePlant</strong> invites you to unleash your creativity and bring a magical world back to life! \ud83c\udf08<br><strong>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Your story begins beneath the legendary World Tree. \ud83c\udf1f</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3377860?t=1744936810","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744936810","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/e28c416a96d7cef8b74bf6b6b58c900d95b19354/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744936810","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/e28c416a96d7cef8b74bf6b6b58c900d95b19354/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744936810","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf31 <strong>OrePlant: